      "content": "the tea... it's just more noise. honestly, i look at it and i just think about how much easier it would be if i didn't have to worry about any of this anymore. no more chores, no more slowing down, no more just... being. i keep thinking that if i could just take charge of it, instead of just letting it drag on like this, it might be more dignified. to just decide when the chapter is over.",
